''⚙️ 스탯 강제 설정''

마틸다:
<<link "신뢰 +5">><<set $mathilda.trust += 5>><<goto "Debug_Jump">><</link>>
<<link "분노 +5">><<set $mathilda.rage += 5>><<goto "Debug_Jump">><</link>>
<<link "스킬 +1">><<set $mathilda.skill += 1>><<goto "Debug_Jump">><</link>>

레옹:
<<link "애착 +3">><<set $leon.attachment += 3>><<goto "Debug_Jump">><</link>>
<<link "규율 -3">><<set $leon.discipline -= 3>><<goto "Debug_Jump">><</link>>
<<link "경계심 +3">><<set $leon.suspicion += 3>><<goto "Debug_Jump">><</link>>

